## Merge origin/master into develop (resolve PR #130 conflicts)

Context:
PR #130 (Release v0.7.0 — deploy develop → master) was CONFLICTING because
master carried 26 commits (0.6.1 / 0.6.2 hotfixes + Dependabot) that never
landed back on develop. Merged `origin/master` into `develop` and resolved
all conflicted paths so the release PR can merge cleanly. Version stays
0.7.0. Most Lakebase hotfixes from master were already present on develop
via earlier cherry-picks; kept master's release notes / changelogs and the
portable Databricks CLI profile default.

Changes:

1. `CONTRIBUTORS.md` / `README.md` / `pyproject.toml`
   Kept develop 0.7.0 branding and version; community contributors list
   already included both develop and master entries after auto-merge.
2. `scripts/bootstrap/lakebase-perms.sh`, `scripts/deploy.sh`
   Kept develop's `scripts/_internal/` paths after the scripts reorg;
   dropped duplicate root copies of `_lakebase-diag.sh` /
   `_lakebase-resolve-db.py` that master re-added (identical content).
3. `scripts/deploy.config.sh`
   Adopted master's portable
   `DEFAULT_DATABRICKS_PROFILE="${DEFAULT_DATABRICKS_PROFILE-DEFAULT}"`
   and removed a duplicated `0e` profile-export block from the auto-merge.
4. `src/agents/tools/mapping.py`
   Kept develop's `unmapped_attributes` normalisation.
5. `src/back/core/graphdb/lakebase/_companion_ddl.py`
   Kept `TRY_CAST` / `sql_cast` wrap and `is_lakeflow_sync_owner`; removed
   an auto-merge duplicate of the triple-table DDL constants.
6. `src/back/objects/digitaltwin/_build_pipeline.py`,
   `src/back/objects/registry/scheduler.py`
   Took develop's structural rewrites (generic scheduled-task registry and
   managed_synced build steps) wholesale.
7. `tests/units/core/test_lakebase_flat_store.py`,
   `tests/units/scripts/test_lakebase_resolve_db.py`
   Kept develop's TRY_CAST assertions, `scheduler_tasks.build` import, and
   `_internal` resolve-db path.
8. `changelogs/v0.6.1/*`, `changelogs/v0.6.2/*`,
   `releases/ReleaseNotes_V0.6.1.md`, `releases/ReleaseNotes_V0.6.2.md`,
   `releases/Roadmap_2026-07.md`, `tests/conftest.py`,
   `.github/workflows/lint-pr-title.yml`
   Brought in from master (historical release docs + pytest `.env` Lakebase
   isolation).

